body:
Hello Charry, Steve, Haley and Will,

Sorry, we are a bit late to send any christmas greetings but don't want to
miss the occasion to send you all our best wishes for happiness, health,
success (and whatever you might wish...) for the coming millennium.

We have stayed here in Brie for Christmas this year and celebrated with
the French part of the family. The girls are on Christmas holiday and next
week, after a big party here on the 31th, we will go down south to Provence
to catch some sun rays.

Hope you are all well

Cheerio,

Katharina, Didier, Julia and
Mathilda

PS: I cut over half a meter of my hair which is very short now !!!

----- Original Message -----
From: Charry and Steve <charryl@pacbell.net>
To: <Aldpal@aol.com>; <ally@waika9.com>; <alma_ogana@yahoo.com>;
